<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρρος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>end of the os sacrum</i> (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρροπύγιον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.127
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				122
			</span></i>, Moer.<i><span class="en">
				p.284
			</span></i> P., <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.565f
			</span></i>; but <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				<u>Diff.</u>
				p.27
			</span></i>) identifies it with 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.173
			</span></i> ; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράμις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				101
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>rump,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				222
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				1239
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				964
			</span></i>, etc. (The orig. form was prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρσος</span> (contained in 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρσοπύγιον,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρροπ-</span>
			, and perh. in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρσοθύρη</span>), cf. O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>ears,</i> OHG. <i>ars,</i> etc.: akin also to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρά.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
